# Response headers for every page and file (Cloudflare Workers static assets).
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/static-assets/headers/
#
# HSTS: every .dev domain is already on browsers' HSTS preload list (HTTPS only, permanently),
# so this states what browsers already enforce; no gradual rollout needed, unlike careerbonus.co.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
